				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event6_hero_2"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]おうじ『ああっ！
それだけは　やめろ！</Text>
